Your weekend listen 🎧

Quantum computers threaten one part of Ethereum Classic: transaction signatures.

On ETC Community Call #63, Istora @Istora_ETC and Diego (@diega) lay out a proposed path:
→ Bastion (ECIP-1130)
→ ECIP-1120, an EIP-1559-style fee market with the basefee paid to miners
→ Quantum-safe signatures, built on top of both

Full call in the reply.

---

The clip covers the path. The full call goes further:

→ The first quantum-safe payment on ETC
→ What "proof of seed phrase" could mean for old wallets
→ Whether dormant coins should ever be frozen

